constraints:
1 <= N <= 10^{5}
1 <= S[i] <= F[i] <= 10^{9}
Sum of N over all test cases doesn't exceeds 10^{6}

expected time complexity: O(N*log(N))
expected auxiliary space: O(N)

standard_solution_code:
from typing import List

class Solution:

	def maxMeetings(self, N: int, S: List[int], F: List[int]) -> List[int]:
		A = []
		for i in range(N):
			A.append([S[i], F[i], i + 1])
		A.sort(key=lambda x: (x[1], x[2]))
		c = 1
		time = A[0][1]
		ans = [A[0][2]]
		for i in range(1, N):
			if A[i][0] > time:
				c += 1
				ans.append(A[i][2])
				time = A[i][1]
			else:
				pass
		return sorted(ans)
